  "details": "Since the beginning of the group instances with moderation tools, it greatly reduced nuisance significantly, however with Group Public Instances, we are still seeing people joining into the world playing ear rape audios and harassing others when moderator of the instance not around. \n\nI would like to suggest some new options for group instances:\n\n1. Rank Limited, Only above certain player rank and enter the instance to minimise visitor and new user being nuisance to other players inside the instance.\n\n2. Group Member Limit, if the player is inside certain group (e.g. VRChat Trolls), the Group Public type instance will not allow those player joining the instance.\n\nMore on the group instance would be nice to have queues that prioritise group members for any group instance.",
